WEBVTT

01:31.456 --> 01:34.016
[Episode 12]

01:34.016 --> 01:38.079
[Small, Big]

01:38.079 --> 01:40.719
Miss, wait a moment. I'll find you a game.

01:42.879 --> 01:43.920
I'll gamble with you.

01:49.239 --> 01:51.280
Please sit, Sir.

01:56.239 --> 01:57.359
In that case,

01:59.319 --> 02:00.319
let's begin.

02:01.319 --> 02:02.519
The game begins.

02:02.519 --> 02:04.719
Enjoy yourselves, guests.

02:22.639 --> 02:23.719
The points are the same.

02:23.719 --> 02:25.560
According to the rules
of Xingrong Gambling House,

02:25.560 --> 02:27.120
the banker has the advantage.

02:27.120 --> 02:29.159
Therefore, this lady wins.

02:29.159 --> 02:31.599
In a gambling house,
one's birth is not asked,

02:31.599 --> 02:32.599
the status is ignored,

02:33.560 --> 02:34.800
and only skill matters.

02:35.840 --> 02:39.120
You won this round
because of the house rules.

02:39.120 --> 02:40.120
If you ignore the rules,

02:40.120 --> 02:43.439
one day, you will also
be cast out of the game.

02:43.439 --> 02:44.719
If you set the rules,

02:45.560 --> 02:46.840
I'll have no choice but to accept.

02:46.840 --> 02:49.240
But at this moment, you must accept defeat.

02:49.240 --> 02:52.000
Since you're so eager to win,
I'll play along to the end.

02:53.159 --> 02:54.159
Again.

03:03.520 --> 03:04.520
This lady wins.

03:06.039 --> 03:07.039
Again.

03:37.080 --> 03:38.240
This lady wins again.

03:41.199 --> 03:43.759
Mr. He, since you have no more silver,

03:43.759 --> 03:45.639
you have no right to gamble with me.

03:47.039 --> 03:48.039
Let's call it a day.

03:50.800 --> 03:53.439
Thank you, honored guest.

03:53.439 --> 03:55.719
Our gambling house has many other games.

03:55.719 --> 03:57.759
Why not step into a private room and rest?

03:57.759 --> 03:58.759
Better luck is yet to come.

04:17.399 --> 04:19.399
Guests, please rest for a moment.

04:29.959 --> 04:32.120
Situ Xue was not sent by me.

04:54.279 --> 04:55.680
Why is Your Majesty following me?

04:56.800 --> 05:00.079
Next time you investigate a place like this,
take someone with you.

05:00.079 --> 05:04.319
But the Censorate has no one else
apart from the "handsome young man" you said.

05:04.319 --> 05:06.319
Do you want the entire gambling house to know

05:06.319 --> 05:09.040
that the ruler of the country came here
to gamble and vent with you?

05:09.040 --> 05:10.879
Outside the palace gates, just call me He Du.

05:16.360 --> 05:17.360
After Shazhou,

05:18.680 --> 05:19.680
there is no more He Du.

05:22.680 --> 05:27.079
What Your Majesty says and does
teaches me the ruler-subject divide.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.759
Let us each stay in our proper place.

05:43.079 --> 05:44.079
What are you doing?

05:50.079 --> 05:51.079
Yue.

05:52.480 --> 05:53.480
Gui.

05:53.480 --> 05:54.480
Yue.

05:56.879 --> 05:59.120
This is the silver I've saved up this month.

05:59.120 --> 06:01.759
Give it to Ms. Meng and beg her to show mercy

06:01.759 --> 06:04.920
to see if she can hold off
sending you up to the second floor.

06:04.920 --> 06:05.920
Here.

06:10.120 --> 06:11.120
Gui,

06:11.879 --> 06:13.600
thank you for always pulling strings for me.

06:15.240 --> 06:18.680
But now, Mr. Hao has personally named me.

06:19.399 --> 06:20.600
I can't escape tomorrow's game

06:22.519 --> 06:23.600
on the second floor.

06:29.319 --> 06:31.120
I embroidered this handkerchief myself.

06:33.959 --> 06:35.439
Just keep it as a keepsake.

06:44.319 --> 06:45.759
I won't let you go upstairs.

06:45.759 --> 06:47.360
There are still several hours left.

06:47.360 --> 06:48.360
I'll go gather the money.

06:50.519 --> 06:53.160
Yue, wait for me.

07:08.399 --> 07:09.680
Honored guests,

07:09.680 --> 07:11.480
this gambling house has many new games.

07:11.480 --> 07:13.040
Let me take you for a few more hands.

07:14.839 --> 07:18.279
Gui, I hear your gambling house
is full of hidden talent.

07:19.160 --> 07:21.360
I came to gather some news at first,

07:22.920 --> 07:26.079
but I never thought
that I would win so much silver.

07:27.480 --> 07:30.199
What news are you trying to gather?

07:30.199 --> 07:31.319
Perhaps I can help.

07:35.519 --> 07:36.879
Do you know about the Huxiao Gang?

07:51.839 --> 07:53.959
If you want news on the Huxiao Gang,

07:53.959 --> 07:56.240
wait for me at the house's back door
with 600 tales of silver.

08:06.336 --> 08:08.032
[Wanchun Pavilion]

08:57.639 --> 09:01.080
After all these years,
you have finally achieved your wish

09:01.080 --> 09:03.480
and become a gang leader
who commands respect far and wide.

09:03.480 --> 09:06.679
When my mother and I
were abandoned by that brat,

09:07.759 --> 09:09.039
I swore to myself in secret

09:10.000 --> 09:11.039
that I must become strong.

09:11.840 --> 09:13.360
Only by seizing the initiative

09:14.120 --> 09:16.759
can I avoid being discarded like a dog.

09:19.240 --> 09:22.120
Alright, it's all in the past now.

09:26.200 --> 09:27.200
Pavilion Master Liu.

09:28.840 --> 09:29.840
I'll go take a look.

09:50.399 --> 09:51.399
Where is the silver?

09:54.840 --> 09:56.240
What exactly do you know?

09:56.240 --> 09:58.320
You must first let us know its value.

09:58.320 --> 10:01.159
What if you go back on your word
after I speak?

10:01.159 --> 10:02.200
Give me the silver first.

10:03.200 --> 10:04.519
What if you are deceiving us?

10:05.240 --> 10:08.240
This gambling house's second floor
holds an unspeakable secret.

10:08.879 --> 10:11.759
The one protecting it is the Huxiao Gang.

10:14.240 --> 10:15.240
What secret?

10:17.480 --> 10:18.960
I've been here for a year now.

10:18.960 --> 10:21.720
I know Huxiao Gang's dealings
with the gambling house.

10:21.720 --> 10:24.159
If you want to know more,
give me the silver first.

10:24.159 --> 10:25.639
I need to hurry and save Yue.

10:25.639 --> 10:27.759
- Who is Yue?
- Yue is from my hometown.

10:27.759 --> 10:29.440
She is about to be sent to the second floor.

10:29.440 --> 10:30.480
We'll go with you.

10:30.480 --> 10:31.480
No.

10:31.480 --> 10:33.960
If the gambling house
finds out about our deal,

10:33.960 --> 10:37.279
both Yue and I will die.

10:37.279 --> 10:38.480
I beg of you.

10:38.480 --> 10:40.159
I am truly desperate for this money.

10:40.879 --> 10:42.200
Wait for me for an hour.

10:42.200 --> 10:43.639
Just an hour.

10:43.639 --> 10:46.559
I swear that I will definitely come back.

10:50.120 --> 10:51.559
Thank you.

10:54.639 --> 10:56.840
He said Yue is about to be sent
to the second floor.

10:57.559 --> 10:59.919
What secret exactly is hidden
on the second floor?

11:00.679 --> 11:02.559
Since it is related to the Huxiao Gang,

11:02.559 --> 11:04.799
we need to get up to the second floor
and see what's there.

11:15.080 --> 11:16.559
It seems to be someone from the Censorate.

11:17.360 --> 11:20.360
They came to the Wanxiang Pavilion
to track your whereabouts.

11:20.360 --> 11:22.200
They show up at our door?

11:22.960 --> 11:24.240
Meng Ting Hui didn't die.

11:25.159 --> 11:26.519
And you killed Wan Kai.

11:26.519 --> 11:27.840
Now

11:27.840 --> 11:31.000
the court is targeting the Huxiao Gang.

11:31.000 --> 11:32.120
What do we do next?

11:32.120 --> 11:33.120
What is there to fear?

11:33.879 --> 11:35.799
She escaped last time,

11:35.799 --> 11:36.799
but I'd like to see

11:36.799 --> 11:41.000
how capable she is to slip away
from my grasp again.

11:47.480 --> 11:48.720
No need to worry.

11:48.720 --> 11:50.759
Don't we have someone in the court?

11:52.639 --> 11:54.039
But I am worried about you.

11:55.200 --> 11:59.159
Even he might not truly protect you.

11:59.159 --> 12:01.080
Have you forgotten how he used you before?

12:01.759 --> 12:04.559
The higher the position,
the crueler he becomes.

12:04.559 --> 12:07.559
The higher the position, the better he's
at weighing the gains and losses,

12:08.200 --> 12:09.240
and the more he fears being exposed.

12:09.919 --> 12:12.080
You carry on with the plan
to keep the money coming.

12:12.080 --> 12:13.600
Don't panic.

12:13.600 --> 12:14.720
As for Meng Ting Hui,

12:15.960 --> 12:18.039
sooner or later,
I will make her fall into my hands.

12:19.399 --> 12:20.600
Look at you.

12:20.600 --> 12:22.080
Inside the Wanxiang Pavilion,

12:22.080 --> 12:24.759
if anyone dares to leak my news,

12:24.759 --> 12:26.120
just kill them.

12:26.120 --> 12:27.120
I know.

12:31.480 --> 12:32.480
Remember,

12:33.080 --> 12:35.799
anyone in this world can betray me

12:37.120 --> 12:38.120
except you.

12:39.720 --> 12:43.320
Because I can't bear to harm you.

12:47.399 --> 12:50.200
In this world, you can distrust anyone,

12:51.039 --> 12:52.759
but you must trust me.

13:00.440 --> 13:01.679
[Xingrong Gambling House]
It's already been an hour.

13:02.399 --> 13:03.399
Let's go in and take a look.

13:16.039 --> 13:17.039
What happened?

13:18.039 --> 13:19.039
Gui?

13:27.360 --> 13:29.240
S-Save

13:30.720 --> 13:31.720
Yue.

14:23.360 --> 14:25.360
What are you looking at? Move aside!

14:25.360 --> 14:26.679
Never seen a gambler took his own life?

14:29.039 --> 14:30.039
Come on.

14:31.200 --> 14:32.200
What bad luck.

14:46.976 --> 14:50.496
[Censorate]

14:56.360 --> 14:58.360
The food is ready. Let's eat first.

15:00.200 --> 15:02.120
Wan Kai left this behind before he died.

15:03.120 --> 15:04.639
What exactly was his intention?

15:12.759 --> 15:15.039
With my years of experience
traveling the world,

15:15.720 --> 15:17.360
roaming all the great mountains,

15:18.120 --> 15:20.039
and having read extensively...

15:26.759 --> 15:28.000
I also don't know.

15:28.000 --> 15:29.799
I suggest we eat first instead.

15:33.919 --> 15:35.399
Could this be a map?

15:37.200 --> 15:39.480
The Huxiao Gang tried to kill him.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.480
He harbored a deep grudge.

15:41.159 --> 15:42.799
So he wanted to use this map

15:42.799 --> 15:45.039
to guide us to find the Huxiao Gang's base.

15:45.039 --> 15:46.960
You make a fair point, Miss Shen.

15:46.960 --> 15:48.720
But he was barely clinging to life back then.

15:48.720 --> 15:51.159
Drawing a map would have taken a long time.

15:51.159 --> 15:53.279
A message that was conveyed
at the brink of death

15:55.000 --> 15:56.679
might be related to identity.

15:56.679 --> 15:58.480
You make an even fairer point, Miss Meng.

15:58.480 --> 15:59.480
Identity?

16:00.720 --> 16:01.720
Who could it be?

16:04.399 --> 16:05.639
The lead on Wan Kai is cut off.

16:07.600 --> 16:08.720
What about you two?

16:08.720 --> 16:11.159
Have you found anything on Changle Street?

16:11.159 --> 16:12.799
Everything else is normal.

16:12.799 --> 16:14.799
But I went to the Wanxiang Pavilion
for a few days

16:14.799 --> 16:16.759
and never saw the Pavilion Master.

16:16.759 --> 16:19.600
Normally, the Pavilion Master
should greet guests personally.

16:19.600 --> 16:22.279
Other than that, there is nothing suspicious.

16:23.279 --> 16:25.519
I checked the tea house, medical clinic,
and other places

16:25.519 --> 16:26.879
and haven't found anything suspicious so far.

16:26.879 --> 16:29.759
Since something feels off,
we must stay alert.

16:29.759 --> 16:32.080
For now, the clearest lead
related to the Huxiao Gang

16:33.320 --> 16:34.559
is that gambling house.

16:34.559 --> 16:35.559
Then seal it off.

16:35.559 --> 16:37.000
According to the Laws of Ning Empire,

16:37.000 --> 16:38.720
sealing it off requires solid evidence.

16:38.720 --> 16:40.440
The gambling house
looks normal on the outside.

16:40.440 --> 16:43.000
And gambling isn't banned in Ning Empire,
so it's still a legal business.

16:43.000 --> 16:44.720
Let's not alert the target for now.

16:44.720 --> 16:45.799
There is just one thing

16:47.080 --> 16:48.080
I need to entrust to you.

16:55.968 --> 16:58.799
[Xingrong Gambling House]

16:58.799 --> 17:00.600
No changing bets!

17:01.360 --> 17:03.840
- No changing bets!
- Please.

17:04.920 --> 17:06.200
Come on, hurry up and bet!

17:06.200 --> 17:07.680
- No changing bets!
- Big!

17:07.680 --> 17:09.519
- Reveal it!
- Reveal it!

17:09.519 --> 17:10.640
No changing bets!

17:23.680 --> 17:25.200
Please come inside.

17:25.200 --> 17:26.200
What's wrong?

17:31.039 --> 17:32.039
It's nothing.

17:33.640 --> 17:35.720
Zhi Li, Yin Qing, and Fu Zhi

17:36.359 --> 17:40.000
emptied their pockets
to barely scrape together 1,000 taels.

17:40.000 --> 17:43.039
We need to win ten rounds in a row
to make it 10,000 taels.

17:43.039 --> 17:45.279
Luckily, we have you, Mr. He.

17:45.279 --> 17:46.759
Since we're going to the second floor,

17:46.759 --> 17:48.160
you must have had the silver ready.

17:54.000 --> 17:55.000
I knew it.

17:56.559 --> 17:58.039
When it comes to generosity,

17:58.039 --> 18:00.920
Who in Ning Empire would have the nerve
to steal your thunder, Mr. He?

18:00.920 --> 18:03.519
This is my personal savings
scraped together over half a year.

18:04.279 --> 18:05.279
But seriously,

18:06.920 --> 18:10.440
you're not as stingy
as Mr. Shen complained you were.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.759
- What did you say?
- Mr. He, let's focus on the business.

18:15.880 --> 18:16.880
Another round.

18:23.079 --> 18:24.079
What a big spender!

18:28.160 --> 18:29.160
I go with big.

18:30.519 --> 18:31.519
Stingy.

18:34.319 --> 18:37.240
Ten thousand taels on big.
One round decides the winner.

18:39.799 --> 18:41.680
Ten thousand taels? I bet on small.

18:41.680 --> 18:42.759
Small. I bet on small too.

18:48.559 --> 18:50.440
Alright. No changing bets.

18:50.440 --> 18:59.359
Small!

18:59.359 --> 19:00.680
Big.

19:00.680 --> 19:01.839
Small!

19:04.160 --> 19:06.720
With your earlier gesture
of throwing away a fortune,

19:06.720 --> 19:09.079
I thought you were a master.

19:09.079 --> 19:12.240
As expected, you're really a "master".

19:12.240 --> 19:13.240
Indeed.

19:14.680 --> 19:16.880
Ten thousand taels
couldn't even buy a bit of fun.

19:16.880 --> 19:18.680
Since the gambling here is boring,

19:18.680 --> 19:19.960
let's find another place.

19:22.799 --> 19:23.799
Alright.

19:25.079 --> 19:26.680
Gentlemen, please wait.

19:29.880 --> 19:31.839
If a high roller like you leaves,

19:31.839 --> 19:34.319
my boss will say
I don't know how to treat guests.

19:34.319 --> 19:36.839
What? Are we not free to leave?

19:37.599 --> 19:38.599
You misunderstand.

19:38.599 --> 19:41.799
We are the only gambling house
guaranteed by capital officials.

19:41.799 --> 19:43.000
We'd never wrong our guests.

19:44.160 --> 19:45.559
Guaranteed by capital officials?

19:46.359 --> 19:47.720
That is interesting.

19:47.720 --> 19:53.039
The way you splashed a fortune here today
was truly impressive.

19:53.039 --> 19:55.880
My boss specifically had me
invite you to the second floor

19:55.880 --> 19:57.400
to experience more interesting games.

19:58.160 --> 19:59.319
Please do us the honor.

19:59.319 --> 20:01.216
[From the Gambling House]

20:01.920 --> 20:03.839
So you already knew those ten thousand taels

20:03.839 --> 20:05.000
weren't coming back.

20:06.680 --> 20:07.759
It's a pity I bet on big.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.960
It will be deducted from your salary.

20:13.000 --> 20:15.799
Once on the second floor,
you must not speak much.

20:16.720 --> 20:18.680
May I ask what the game is tonight?

20:18.680 --> 20:21.319
It wouldn't be right to bet without knowing.

20:21.319 --> 20:23.160
All games are carefully arranged by us.

20:23.920 --> 20:26.759
If you two find it interesting, just join in.

20:27.359 --> 20:29.319
Considering it's your first time here,

20:29.319 --> 20:30.839
I'll give you a hint as an exception.

20:30.839 --> 20:32.240
Tonight is a blind bet.

20:32.240 --> 20:34.519
The stakes are antique porcelain vases.

20:35.440 --> 20:37.559
What's so special about mere antiques?

20:38.960 --> 20:40.440
Please be patient, Sir.

20:40.440 --> 20:42.079
After you two have won the bid,

20:42.079 --> 20:44.799
you will understand
the intrigue and pleasure within.

20:44.799 --> 20:47.720
Remember, you must be silent during the game.

20:47.720 --> 20:48.880
A silent gamble

20:49.599 --> 20:50.920
holds the true pleasure.

20:56.301 --> 20:58.528
[From the Gambling House]

21:07.319 --> 21:10.000
Gentlemen, please.

21:10.000 --> 21:12.839
The real game has begun.

21:26.640 --> 21:28.240
The rules for today's game are as follows.

21:28.240 --> 21:32.440
You need only note the number
of your chosen porcelain vase in your letter,

21:32.440 --> 21:33.680
and after three gong strikes,

21:33.680 --> 21:36.000
the highest bidder wins the treasure.

22:01.160 --> 22:03.599
These antique porcelain vases
are nothing special.

22:04.240 --> 22:05.680
But these women

22:05.680 --> 22:07.559
are each gentle and virtuous,

22:07.559 --> 22:09.599
and their every move
is graceful as a noble lady's.

22:10.319 --> 22:11.880
It's a gamble on vases.

22:11.880 --> 22:14.279
But why are they dressed as scholars?

22:17.799 --> 22:19.519
They have fair skin,

22:19.519 --> 22:21.319
without the calluses of poor girls

22:21.319 --> 22:23.440
or the coquettishness of courtesans.

22:23.440 --> 22:26.519
Could they also be forced women like Yue?

22:26.519 --> 22:28.000
Everything here is eerie.

22:28.920 --> 22:30.359
We must find Yue first

22:30.359 --> 22:31.440
[Yue]
to know the truth.

22:56.576 --> 22:57.696
[Vase No. 18, Vase No. 12]

23:06.459 --> 23:07.936
[Yue]

23:20.680 --> 23:23.799
Tonight's top piece is this willow-leaf vase
from the previous dynasty.

23:24.400 --> 23:25.880
Congratulations to this honored guest,

23:25.880 --> 23:28.839
who won the top prize
with a bid of twenty thousand taels.

23:36.122 --> 23:37.632
[Yue]

23:38.240 --> 23:40.319
Gui! Gui!

23:42.039 --> 23:43.319
She is Yue.

23:43.319 --> 23:44.319
Gui!

23:44.319 --> 23:46.119
What they are betting on
is not any vase at all.

23:47.359 --> 23:48.359
Follow them.

23:58.480 --> 23:59.480
Harder.

24:00.880 --> 24:02.079
A little harder.

24:07.400 --> 24:08.400
Good.

24:09.559 --> 24:11.000
A little harder.

24:12.160 --> 24:14.440
Good, that's the force.

24:15.440 --> 24:18.039
Good.

24:18.039 --> 24:19.119
Good.

24:23.440 --> 24:26.319
Sir, it's you.

24:26.319 --> 24:28.319
What brings you here?

24:28.960 --> 24:30.000
Come, sit down.

24:31.359 --> 24:32.359
Mr. Hao,

24:33.039 --> 24:34.880
you're living quite comfortably.

24:34.880 --> 24:37.759
It seems you've forgotten
whose gamble house this is.

24:37.759 --> 24:40.920
Sir, w-what are you saying?

24:40.920 --> 24:43.039
I would never dare to forget

24:43.039 --> 24:46.160
that our master is the ultimate owner
of this gambling house.

24:46.160 --> 24:47.160
Well,

24:47.160 --> 24:48.720
business has been booming these days,

24:48.720 --> 24:50.880
so I thought I'd relax a bit.

24:51.799 --> 24:52.799
By the way, Sir,

24:54.960 --> 24:57.200
here is the recent income
of our gambling house.

24:57.200 --> 24:58.440
Please take a look.

25:02.799 --> 25:03.799
Not bad.

25:04.920 --> 25:07.480
I am quite reassured
with the gambling house in your hands.

25:08.279 --> 25:09.279
But Mr. Hao,

25:09.960 --> 25:11.480
now that your purse is full,

25:12.160 --> 25:14.319
don't forget the rules.

25:14.319 --> 25:15.960
How could I dare forget?

25:15.960 --> 25:18.519
I was just thinking
about offering more tribute to Master.

25:18.519 --> 25:19.920
By the way, Sir,

25:19.920 --> 25:22.599
if the east-end gambling house
belongs to me as well,

25:23.319 --> 25:25.519
you will also have a share in it.

25:25.519 --> 25:26.519
Wait a moment, Sir.

25:33.839 --> 25:34.839
Sir.

25:38.240 --> 25:39.240
Sir.

25:42.480 --> 25:43.480
There is one more thing.

25:44.160 --> 25:45.759
Recently, the Censorate--

25:45.759 --> 25:46.759
Mr. Hao!

25:48.319 --> 25:49.319
Mr. Hao.

25:50.480 --> 25:53.039
You want to die?
How many times have I said it?

25:53.039 --> 25:54.559
Knock before entering.

25:54.559 --> 25:57.160
Yes, I'll go back and knock now.

25:57.160 --> 25:58.160
Come back.

26:04.480 --> 26:06.279
Speak. What is it?

26:06.279 --> 26:08.920
If you don't have something serious to say,

26:08.920 --> 26:10.279
I'll skin you alive.

26:10.279 --> 26:13.160
Mr. Hao, this is Zhai,
the gatekeeper of our gambling house.

26:15.319 --> 26:17.039
He says he has something confidential
to tell you.

26:18.599 --> 26:19.599
Confidential?

26:20.960 --> 26:22.480
Mr. Hao.

26:22.480 --> 26:23.559
You, a gatekeeper!

26:24.720 --> 26:27.839
- What confidential business could you have?
- Mr. Hao!

26:27.839 --> 26:30.480
Every unworthy wretch comes to my door!

26:30.480 --> 26:32.240
Do you think my place is a teahouse?

26:32.240 --> 26:33.920
Mr. Hao, Mr. Hao.

26:33.920 --> 26:37.079
Meng Ting Hui from the Censorate
brought a man to the second floor.

26:37.079 --> 26:38.599
- They are up to no good.
- You're a gatekeeper!

26:38.599 --> 26:39.799
Can you be sure it's her?

26:41.279 --> 26:42.279
Wait.

26:43.200 --> 26:45.599
The Censorate
has been on Changle Street lately,

26:45.599 --> 26:47.799
secretly tracking whereabouts
of Master and me.

26:48.559 --> 26:50.599
Tell your men to be smart.

26:50.599 --> 26:52.160
Don't let her get any dirt on us.

26:52.160 --> 26:54.079
They must not find the secret
on the second floor.

26:54.720 --> 26:56.000
I'll take care of it right away.

26:56.000 --> 26:57.480
Move!

27:24.160 --> 27:25.160
Honored guests,

27:25.160 --> 27:26.960
if you go any further,
you are breaking the rules.

28:01.559 --> 28:02.559
It's Yue.

29:10.440 --> 29:11.440
Yue?

29:13.160 --> 29:14.279
She's still breathing.

29:14.279 --> 29:16.119
They were just here. Where are they now?

29:16.119 --> 29:17.960
- Find them!
- Let's go.

29:17.960 --> 29:18.960
Let's go.

29:24.329 --> 29:26.579
[Censorate]

29:40.319 --> 29:41.319
You...

29:44.359 --> 29:45.359
You are

29:46.400 --> 29:49.079
the female Zhuangyuan
who achieved the Triple First,

29:49.079 --> 29:50.279
Miss Meng.

29:51.119 --> 29:52.759
Did you save me?

29:52.759 --> 29:55.079
It was Gui who asked us to save you.

29:55.079 --> 29:56.079
Gui?

29:57.480 --> 29:58.480
Where is he?

30:01.200 --> 30:03.319
Gui risked his life to save you.

30:03.319 --> 30:05.160
He wanted you to live well.

30:12.039 --> 30:13.240
Gui,

30:18.680 --> 30:20.480
I brought this upon you.

30:22.039 --> 30:24.599
I caused your death.

30:24.599 --> 30:27.240
You are weak. Please don't grieve too much.

30:27.880 --> 30:30.640
If you have any grievances,
feel free to tell Miss Meng.

30:30.640 --> 30:33.279
Yes, Miss Meng will seek justice for you.

30:36.920 --> 30:41.440
We were female students
who would take the next Imperial Exam.

30:43.000 --> 30:45.079
We came from humble and remote origins.

30:45.079 --> 30:47.039
Thankfully, His Majesty restarted
the Imperial Exam for women.

30:47.839 --> 30:49.599
Miss Meng, you strongly backed that,

30:50.279 --> 30:53.960
allowing ordinary women
like us to see a way out.

30:54.599 --> 30:58.799
Later, someone came claiming
to be from the capital's Women's Academy,

30:59.759 --> 31:03.279
picking gifted girls across the prefectures
for advanced studies in the capital.

31:04.400 --> 31:05.680
We believed it to be true.

31:06.359 --> 31:07.359
After entering the capital,

31:08.240 --> 31:11.160
we were imprisoned in a residence.

31:11.160 --> 31:14.119
At first, they taught us
music, chess, calligraphy, and painting.

31:14.119 --> 31:16.519
Later, the top students were taken away
and never seen again.

31:17.279 --> 31:22.480
At the same time, new female students
kept arriving at the residence.

31:22.480 --> 31:23.480
Yue,

31:25.599 --> 31:27.440
where is that residence in the capital?

31:27.440 --> 31:29.079
From home to the capital,

31:30.200 --> 31:33.519
we were always kept
in tightly sealed carriages.

31:33.519 --> 31:36.400
Upon arrival at the residence,
we were forbidden from stepping outside.

31:36.400 --> 31:37.759
How long have you been here?

31:38.839 --> 31:41.200
And how did you meet Gui?

31:41.880 --> 31:43.759
I have been in the capital
for over three months.

31:45.279 --> 31:48.960
By chance, I recognized Gui
who delivered vegetables to the residence.

31:51.079 --> 31:54.039
From him, I learned

31:55.839 --> 31:57.640
that those female students
who were taken away

31:59.640 --> 32:02.359
were all sent to the second floor
of the gambling house,

32:02.359 --> 32:05.880
becoming the playthings of those gamblers
in the form of bets.

32:08.279 --> 32:11.680
Those gamblers are all depraved brutes.

32:12.759 --> 32:16.119
They take pleasure in torturing women,
and their methods are cruel.

32:17.440 --> 32:19.200
Thanks to Gui before,

32:19.200 --> 32:21.880
I was delayed
from being sent to the second floor.

32:22.839 --> 32:24.920
Didn't you think about escaping?

32:29.519 --> 32:30.519
We tried.

32:31.599 --> 32:32.680
We even reported it.

32:34.759 --> 32:37.160
But the officials were in cahoots with them.

32:38.519 --> 32:40.880
After escaping,
we were caught and brought back.

32:40.880 --> 32:43.920
Some of us had our limbs cut off
and were tortured to death.

32:45.079 --> 32:47.400
Unable to bear the humiliation,
many female students

32:48.759 --> 32:50.359
chose suicide.

32:52.799 --> 32:53.799
Do you know

32:53.799 --> 32:55.039
which court officials

32:56.440 --> 32:58.319
are colluding with them?

33:02.079 --> 33:03.599
And who captured you?

33:04.200 --> 33:05.680
I only heard among them

33:07.319 --> 33:08.880
someone called Master Lv Da.

33:16.799 --> 33:18.200
He is Lv Er's older brother.

33:18.200 --> 33:19.519
I saw him before.

33:19.519 --> 33:22.680
Do you know anything
about the guests upstairs?

33:23.400 --> 33:25.079
Especially those who took you away.

33:26.079 --> 33:29.279
They all wore masks.

33:30.039 --> 33:31.039
I only remember

33:32.319 --> 33:34.839
that the man wore a red jade thumb ring

33:34.839 --> 33:36.960
etched with a caged bird on it.

33:36.960 --> 33:40.440
Last night was my first time going up...

33:42.279 --> 33:43.279
up...

33:45.839 --> 33:47.319
Yue.

33:52.240 --> 33:53.319
Miss Meng,

33:54.599 --> 33:55.640
thank you.

33:57.519 --> 34:01.319
I know my health condition.

34:03.319 --> 34:04.599
It's too late.

34:14.000 --> 34:15.000
Listen.

34:16.679 --> 34:18.079
It's the sound of reading.

34:57.079 --> 34:58.679
The realm

34:59.280 --> 35:00.519
may be divided.

35:01.800 --> 35:02.800
The emolument

35:03.800 --> 35:05.559
may be refused.

35:05.559 --> 35:06.559
The blade

35:07.599 --> 35:08.760
can be trampled upon.

35:10.960 --> 35:11.960
But the Mean

35:13.639 --> 35:14.800
cannot be reached.

36:05.440 --> 36:08.199
Yue, I'm here.

36:15.119 --> 36:16.119
I'll take you away.

36:39.119 --> 36:40.119
Gui.

36:46.599 --> 36:47.599
Yue.

36:48.800 --> 36:49.800
- Yue.
- Miss Meng.

36:52.239 --> 36:57.760
Miss Meng, how I wish I could be like you,

37:00.159 --> 37:01.159
to study

37:02.960 --> 37:08.800
and earn a scholarly rank.

37:16.840 --> 37:17.840
Yue?

37:21.079 --> 37:22.079
Yue?

37:44.440 --> 37:45.440
Yue,

37:46.639 --> 37:48.440
I will definitely make those villains

37:51.440 --> 37:52.960
pay blood for blood.

38:05.920 --> 38:08.639
[Why was Wan Kai killed]

38:08.639 --> 38:11.679
Those gamblers spend lavishly.
They must be men of stature.

38:13.159 --> 38:14.880
And those women
got no help from the authorities,

38:15.519 --> 38:18.079
surely because there are many court officials
among the gamblers.

38:18.880 --> 38:22.119
The Huxiao Gang entertains the officials
with those women

38:22.119 --> 38:24.000
and uses it as leverage

38:24.000 --> 38:25.840
to make them their protective umbrella.

38:30.440 --> 38:32.159
Those women harbored great ambitions,

38:33.760 --> 38:35.599
wanting to contribute to the court,

38:36.960 --> 38:39.679
but fell into the quagmire of officialdom
and had their lives ruined.

38:40.400 --> 38:41.440
What is laughable is that

38:43.840 --> 38:45.320
[Huxiao Gang]
those murderers

38:47.000 --> 38:48.400
sit high in the halls of power

38:49.239 --> 38:50.400
and act with utter impunity.

39:10.400 --> 39:12.000
[Masked Man]

39:21.000 --> 39:22.199
Be it the Huxiao Gang

39:23.800 --> 39:25.119
or corrupt officials,

39:26.519 --> 39:29.320
I will drag you down
from your high places one by one

39:30.360 --> 39:32.119
and grind your bones to ashes.

39:33.760 --> 39:35.760
I'll take men to the gambling house now.

39:48.480 --> 39:50.360
I get how angry you feel.

39:50.360 --> 39:53.800
But only by planning carefully
can we catch them all in one sweep.

40:04.639 --> 40:07.159
I watched Yue die in front of me
with my own eyes.

40:08.199 --> 40:09.280
How can I be calm?

40:14.000 --> 40:16.039
Your Majesty, I'm here to escort you back...
